{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27183","headline":"黄蜀葵 · 崔涯","name":"黄蜀葵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"野栏秋景晚，疎散两三枝。\n嫩碧浅轻态，幽香闲澹姿。\n露倾金盏小，风引道冠欹。\n独立悄无语，清愁人讵知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔涯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27183.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27183","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}